@startuml
' AS-IS Integration Context (26.12.2025)
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor User
component "Monolith (Spring Boot)" as Monolith
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
storage "Postgres Main\n(pain_management_db)" as PG
storage "MongoDB\n(analyticsdb)" as MONGO
component "HAPI FHIR Server\n(external)" as FHIR
component "Authentication-Service\n(8082)" as AUTH
component "Reporting-Service\n(8091)" as REPORT
component "Logging-Service\n(8081->8083)" as LOG
component "Backup-Restore\n(8085)" as BACKUP

User --> Monolith : UI / REST
Monolith --> PG : JPA/Hibernate
Monolith --> MONGO : Spring Data Mongo
Kafka --> Monolith : emr.changes (consume)
Monolith --> FHIR : HAPI FHIR (HTTP)

' Planned/available, not wired from monolith yet
Monolith ..> AUTH : planned: JWT validate/login via REST
Monolith ..> REPORT : planned: Kafka reporting-commands\n + REST /api/reports
Monolith ..> LOG : planned: Kafka logging-events (producer)
Monolith ..> BACKUP : optional ops REST
@enduml
